<title>UK: Siebe allows bid for Whessoe to lapse.</title>
<headline>Siebe allows bid for Whessoe to lapse.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering and controls giant Siebe Plc said on Thursday it had allowed its offer for instruments and controls company Whessoe Plc to lapse.</p>
<p>Siebe had earlier said it would not increase its earlier 155 pence per share offer following a rival offer of 175 pence per share.</p>
</text>
